--[[
================================================================================

        S C A N N E R S        (ObjectScanner)

        DOORS' scanner and four more, the one you pick, in your inventory and
        working. Five kinds:

            Nokia     DOORS' own scanner (the Mines'), its model and animations
            Tablet    the NVCS tablet: it sees the room through its screen
            Computer  a small laptop that opens and closes, with a terminal
            Phone     a phone: radar, a flashlight, and its colour, yours to pick
            GameBoy   a handheld with the map of the room, seen from above

        Each in three versions: Normal, Guiding Light (blue) and Curious Light
        (yellow), with their glow. Its inventory picture is drawn in its own
        colours: the colour of its screen and of its body, always.

            _G.Scanner = { Type = "Phone", Variant = "Guiding" }   -- optional
            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/main/ObjectScanner"))()

        Type       "Nokia" (the default), "Tablet", "Computer", "Phone", "GameBoy"
        Variant    "Normal" (the default), "Guiding", "Curious"
        Color      its screen (Color3): by default the kind's own, or the Light's
        BodyColor  its body (Color3), for the Computer, the Phone and the GameBoy
        FPS        how many times a second its screen is drawn (30, as DOORS')

        In your hand:
            Left click   turn it on / off      (in an app: its action)
            Right click  inspect it            (in an app: its other action)
            F            the next function
            L            a trick: it flies, it spins, it falls...
            X            drop it (E to pick it up)

        Its functions (F): SCANNER (DOORS' own: what is worth finding),
        ENTITIES (what is coming, and from where), EXIT (an arrow to the next
        door), HIDING (where to hide), TRAPS (fake doors, snares, Giggles); and
        each kind its own: Nokia SNAKE, Tablet X-RAY, Computer TERMINAL, Phone
        COLOR and LIGHT, GameBoy MAP.

        Run it again to change kind: the old one goes away. Its battery never
        runs out.

================================================================================
]]

